    advanced: 'The Durchmarsch Gambit: If you hold 3+ Jacks and several Aces, you might try to win every single trick. This is high risk; if you miss even one trick, you will likely end up with the most points and take the penalty.',
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Jacks are only 2 points but they 'pull' other cards. Use them to force opponents to play their Aces.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "The 'Kalter Schlag' (surprise loss) usually happens in the 6th or 7th trick when a player is 'squeezed' into winning a 20+ point trick.",
      },
